    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Despite being a daughter of a noble family in Elmore Kingdom, she was one of the girls buried alive after being captured during the war. As she lay dying, her terror allowed her to summon a devil. She entered into a demonic contract which gave her the power to resurrect the other buried girls as Blood Queens. She hates her parents for allowing her capture as well as those who buried her. Demons Lv. 9 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Demons. M. Atk. +10 Atk. Spd. +5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +2% Resistance to Dark +10% P. Def. -5% Resistance to Holy -10% Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Bare Hands Lv. 1 Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
